          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga arukugambira ati: Hati, ninyija kugarurra Yakobbo obusinge enju ya Isirairi yoona ngigirre embabazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baligwagwana omunsi, hataroho n'omu arukubatiinisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obu ndimara kubagarra, nkabaiha omumahanga, nkabasorooza nkabaiha omunsi ey'abanyanzigwa baabo, ndibeekoonyeza okwoleka amahanga obuhikiriire bwange balyebwa ensoni zaabo, na byona ebi baangobiize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu, nubwo balimanya nkooku ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga wabo, habwokuba nkabaleka baazaahisibwa omumahanga, hanyuma nabasorooza, nabagarra omunsi yabo yonyini, tindireka n'omu omuli bo kugaruka kwikara omumahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA Ruhanga naagamba ati: Obu ndiseesira Mwoyo wange enju ya Isirairi, tindigaruka kubaitira eriiso.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.29"
            ]
          }
        }
